# Generated code is never committed (§147.2): the readable artifact is the source,
# and every typecheck, build and test re-emits first so a fresh clone cannot lack it.
#
# Named one by one rather than ignoring `src/gen/` whole, because §19's tree puts the
# hand-written procedural generators there too — `palette`, `shapes`, `glow`, `synth`,
# `variants`. Those are the source of art, not the output of a tool, and ignoring the
# directory would have deleted them from the repository the first time one was added.
src/gen/sintable.ts
src/gen/loop.ts
src/gen/strokefont.ts
